		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17209&amp;sid=c5ba576851af97192268de4b902a33c1#17209"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Mar 01, 2004 11:00 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: Recruiting Post</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17209&amp;sid=c5ba576851af97192268de4b902a33c1"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I have just made an account on Druzzil Ro Website and was wondering if any would mind if I post a small recruiting message there?  
<br />

<br />
Stating that we are a small RP Preffered Guild looking to expand our ranks and are looking to recruit.  Information that they will want and need may be:  Hours we hunt as groups, events we might plan on doing.  Raiding specific zones, helping eventually to obtain epic weapons, quests we are interested in.  Things of this nature.   
<br />

<br />
I have seen some pretty harsh things in some of the forums, but not in the Guild Recrutiment section.  If we are interested in this, please, let me know.  This was mentioned in an early post as an idea.  Do we still want to carry on with it?
<br />

<br />
I am at your service
<br />

<br />
Ceowulf
<br />
Champion to the Concordat Angelis
<br />
Warrior of 51 Seasons.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
