			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I posted on the DRo boards a while back, got nary a nibble.  Feel free to do so, but I have a bad feeling that a lot of people on the DRo boards are not interested in RPin guilds.  Also, we don't have the force to do much in the way of raiding, but some of us have freinds in other guilds (I myself am in good standing with Alleigance of Honor, so much so that if I ever want an invite, I've got it.  Don't worry, CA is my home) who may be able to help us in some of those aspects.  Emphasis on MAY, many of these high-end raiding guilds are still trying to get things for their own people (an AoH raid I was on saw a 50-ish Dark Elf upgrading his Crustacean Shell Armor.)</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
